 of the inner apartment, seeing the large-eyed Săntă thus arrived with her husband, experienced excess of joy.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.757,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-11-21"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1010028","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"991eb446cb95aad7ea61e17c02a1f92bf8474ea58c9f493f0acd375ad6bf3222","compact":"404dc3c41f0624cd38c2dfd1fce1b31b2baad9da42e6bcba2fdae24899632ddb","nasal":"3e2c6693f2e8a995d01576cc0fd31bab924d277685046beaa7ccf18d442caf98"}},{"id":"VRCE-1-10-29","kanda":1,"kandaId":"bala","sarga":10,"verse":29,"english":"Then honoured by them and the king in especial, she happily spent there some time along with that twice-born one.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.724,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-1-11-22"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"1010029","sanskritFile":"Ram01.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"6eaa49a945345903b613863795848f259b8e5cf7bc23b45ca9219cf0ebe9c44d","compact":"6451339eb81b1147f63c452126abb929aecb477c4a11d99e4489ccd9cbee02a4","nasal":"6451339eb81b1147f63c452126abb929aecb477c4a11d99e4489ccd9cbee02a4"}}]
